ith access to balcony from 12 to 15m2\n\nBathrooms with 6m2 and 3m2\n\nICF (Insulated Concrete Forms) construction - lost formwork system with EPS/XPS thermal insulation on both sides of the reinforced concrete core, ensuring excellent thermal and acoustic insulation, high energy efficiency and environmental sustainability.\n\nHigh thermal and acoustic insulation with A+ energy certification, allow greater thermal comfort all year round and significant reduction of energy costs.\n\nSustainable and environmentally friendly construction\n\nRobust and durable structure \n\nEnergy Rating: A+",
